    {
      "key": "content:demo-content-iterator-boundary",
      "kind": "content",
      "id": "demo-content-iterator-boundary",
      "updatedAt": "2026-05-31T10:30:00.000Z",
      "data": {
        "type": "question",
        "slug": "iterator-boundary-last-example",
        "title": "为什么迭代器的边界条件总在最后一个样例才暴露？",
        "summary": "我想区分 off-by-one、空集合约定和异步结束信号这三类看起来相似的失败。",
        "body": "给定长度为 $n$ 的序列，我把有效位置写作 $0\\le i<n$。同步循环很直观，但当迭代器用 `done` 表示结束时，最后一个值究竟应在 `done=false` 的响应中返回，还是允许和结束信号一起出现？\n\n```ts\nfor (let step = iterator.next(); !step.done; step = iterator.next()) {\n  consume(step.value);\n}\n```\n\n如果输入为空、只有一个元素、以及最后一次读取触发异步补页，最小而完整的测试表应该怎样写？",
        "authorId": "demo-user-paper-boat",
        "status": "published",
        "tags": ["demo-tag-debugging", "demo-tag-web-platform"],
        "locale": "zh-CN",
        "format": "markdown",
        "coverAssetKey": null,
        "attachmentKeys": [],
        "createdAt": "2026-05-30T09:30:00.000Z",
        "publishedAt": "2026-05-31T10:00:00.000Z",
        "sortOrder": 30
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "content:demo-content-paper-to-orbit",
      "kind": "content",
      "id": "demo-content-paper-to-orbit",
      "updatedAt": "2026-05-30T15:00:00.000Z",
      "data": {
        "type": "book",
        "slug": "paper-to-orbit",
        "title": "从纸带到星图：可复现实验笔记",
        "summary": "一本用线性变换、误差传播和浏览器实验串起“如何留下可复查证据”的开放小书。",
        "body": "# 从纸带到星图\n\n## 第一章：把状态写成向量\n\n令实验状态为 $x=(d,p,b)$，分别表示数据版本、persona 与浏览器引擎。一次操作可以看作线性近似 $x' = Ax + \\varepsilon$；真正重要的是记录矩阵 $A$ 中哪些分量由我们主动改变。\n\n## 第二章：误差不会自动解释自己\n\n若观测量为 $y=f(x)$，局部误差满足 $\\Delta y\\approx J_f(x)\\Delta x$。这并不要求每次调试都计算雅可比矩阵，而是提醒我们：同时改变多个输入后，任何单一解释都缺少证据。\n\n```python\ndef experiment(seed, change):\n    before = snapshot(seed)\n    after = apply(change, before)\n    return compare(before, after)\n```\n\n## 第三章：回到同一个起点\n\nreset 的意义不是“清空一切”，而是回到同一份确定 seed，同时保留不属于演示内容的主题与语言选择。只有回程可验证，前面的每条路径才真正组成地图。",
        "authorId": "demo-user-paper-boat",
        "status": "published",
        "tags": ["demo-tag-reproducibility", "demo-tag-linear-algebra", "demo-tag-mathematical-writing"],
        "locale": "zh-CN",
        "format": "latex",
        "coverAssetKey": "demo-asset-cover-book",
        "attachmentKeys": ["demo-asset-attachment-lab-notes"],
        "createdAt": "2026-05-15T08:00:00.000Z",
        "publishedAt": "2026-05-30T14:30:00.000Z",
        "sortOrder": 40
      }
